{"id":"conv_04874","context":"A uni student interviews a retired judge at home","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Thank you for your time today. For my thesis I wanted to interview a former judge.","jp":"本日はお時間いただきありがとうございます。卒論のテーマで、元判事の方にお話を伺いたくて。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,5,7,14,39,56,62,76,94,111,447,492,501,604,730,944,1429,5401,8143,11758,13968],"jpTokens":[{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"いただき","w":1429},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"},{"s":"卒論","r":"そつろん","w":13968},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"テーマ","w":604},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"、"},{"s":"元","r":"もと","w":447},{"s":"判事","r":"はんじ","w":8143},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"方","r":"ほう","w":76},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"お話","r":"おはなし","w":730},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"伺い","r":"うかがい","w":11758},{"s":"たく","w":62},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Oh come now, I retired ten years ago. These days I convalesce at home and tend to the garden.","jp":"いやいや、退官してもう十年だよ。今は自宅療養しながら、のんびり庭の世話をしている身だ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4,5,18,19,21,35,68,87,129,135,153,870,1802,3096,3573,4050,5567,7091,7885,8236,17902],"jpTokens":[{"s":"いやいや","w":7091},{"s":"、"},{"s":"退官","r":"たいかん"},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"もう","w":153},{"s":"十","r":"じゅう","w":135},{"s":"年","r":"ねん","w":35},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"今","r":"いま","w":87},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"自宅","r":"じたく","w":1802},{"s":"療養","r":"りょうよう","w":8236},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"ながら","w":129},{"s":"、"},{"s":"のんびり","w":4050},{"s":"庭","r":"にわ","w":3096},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"世話","r":"せわ","w":5567},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"いる","w":18},{"s":"身","r":"み","w":870},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Sorry to intrude during your recovery. Was there a tria